\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0   A charge to keep I have,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  A God to glorify,
\par  A never-dying soul to save,
\par   And fit it for the sky:
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  To serve the present age,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  My calling to fulfill:
\par  O may it all my powers engage
\par  To do my Master's will!
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Arm me with jealous care,
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 As in Thy sight to live;
\par And O, Thy servant, Lord, prepare
\par A strict account to give.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Help me to watch and pray,
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 And on Thyself rely,
\par And let me ne'er my trust betray,
\par \pard      I shall forever die.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

